Thumbs.db

# ==========================================
# Sensitive Configuration (Application Secrets)
# ==========================================
# Ignore files containing sensitive passwords, JDBC credentials, and API keys
**/src/main/resources/application-local.properties
**/src/main/resources/application-local.yml
**/src/main/resources/config/secrets.*